        "original_id": "a756552b-0c2d-5283-bcb8-59bfb1e6cce1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tata Movus\n- Companies: Tata Motors\n- Concepts: Minivan, MUV, MPV, people carrier, vehicle size classification\n\nFacts:\n- Tata Movus, also called Movus, is a minivan or MUV.\n- Tata Motors manufactures the Tata Movus.\n- A minivan is a vehicle size classification for a high-roof vehicle with a flexible interior layout.\n- A minivan is also called a people carrier in British English.\n- A minivan is also called an MPV, meaning multi-purpose vehicle, or an MUV, meaning multi-utility vehicle.",
